# Russian (standard PC ЙЦУКЕН) layout for keyd. Included by mac.conf and ergodox.conf.
# Alt+Space toggles en <-> ru; Esc in ru switches to en (no Escape sent). Needs ru.compose included from ~/.XCompose.

# Shortcuts in ru mode: with a modifier held, keys emit plain latin keycodes
# (Ctrl+C, Ctrl+Shift+C, Super+W ...) instead of Cyrillic. Explicit mappings in a
# modifier layer drop that modifier, so it must be spelled out (w = M-w).

